{"3833270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Italian BrainBrawl", "steam_appid": 3833270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras/5dc99e37b5a125928f90a9c7fb937dd1.avif?t=1758002129\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world rots, the brains must brawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend says</strong> that every time humanity teeters on the edge of total brainrot —  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When reason collapses under the weight of Memes,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When influencers quote philosophers,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When nobody remembers who invented tiramisù, the Tournament returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian BrainBrawl is an ancient tradition, sacred chaos, and bloodsport that saves the world by punching it in the face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras/caa7ba97acb85c073ef8e18cca2a75d6.avif?t=1758002129\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras_big/caa7ba97acb85c073ef8e18cca2a75d6.avif?t=1758002129 width=800 height=1004 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online chaos for 2–4 players </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local couch brawling with friends (or enemies)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced rounds with explosive, cartoon-style combat </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No cooldowns. No balance. No mercy. Only mayhem.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras/5861a2823be3a6caab0dc3e4c0656e38.avif?t=1758002129\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras_big/5861a2823be3a6caab0dc3e4c0656e38.avif?t=1758002129 width=800 height=930 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the end, only the brawl remains.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras/5dc99e37b5a125928f90a9c7fb937dd1.avif?t=1758002129\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world rots, the brains must brawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legend says</strong> that every time humanity teeters on the edge of total brainrot —  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When reason collapses under the weight of Memes,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When influencers quote philosophers,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When nobody remembers who invented tiramisù, the Tournament returns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Italian BrainBrawl is an ancient tradition, sacred chaos, and bloodsport that saves the world by punching it in the face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras/caa7ba97acb85c073ef8e18cca2a75d6.avif?t=1758002129\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833270/extras_big/caa7ba97acb85c073ef8e18cca2a75d6.avif?t=1758002129 width=800 height=1004 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online chaos for 2–4 players </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local couch brawling with friends (or enemies)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced rounds with explosive, cartoon-style combat </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No cooldowns. No balance. No mercy. Only mayhem.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea